    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Syed Ather Enam, Chair of the Department of Surgery, at the Aga Khan University, was conferred the Sitara-i-Imtiaz - the third highest civilian award by the Government of Pakistan - for his achievements in the field of medicine by President Mamnoon Hussain.",
